      "instructions": "LIQUILENS PRIVATE LIMITED (registered, India). LiquiLens institutions / Seiche funding / Undertow liquidity: https://liquilens.in/company-profile.json.\n\nResearch: cite clocks. Exit costs interpolate roughly hourly quote-depth bands; no book walks/executable quotes. PARTIAL: insufficient scoring/replay, not calm. Sealed calls include misses. Frozen priors: https://api.seiche.info/undertow/calibration.json. trade_safety_exit_context: exact-rung observe/paper; exit_cost: nearest-rung. No execution clearance. Gold: caller assumptions, aware ISO 8601 clocks, settlement/access gates; future proceeds are not cash. No verified balances; not investment advice.\n\nAnonymous: 200/day UTC; X-MCP-Usage-* or https://api.seiche.info/undertow/mcp/usage. /agent at https://t.me/undertow_LiquiLens_bot: tokens, per-call entitlement. Agent $99/mo: unmetered subscriber MCP, 5 watches. Desk $199/mo: 10 detailed watches, terminal. Alerts $29/mo: triggers, 3 watches, no details. Free 7-day /trial: Alerts only; subscriber MCP/meter unchanged. agent_access_status: access."
    }
